24
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:41,759
My Lord!

25
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:45,919
My Lord!

26
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:46,520
My Lord!

27
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,000
My Lord!

28
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:47,840
My Lord!

29
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:49,719
Jiaojiao,

30
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,879
