33
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,479
Yeah, My Lord.

34
00:03:55,759 --> 00:03:57,120
We've fought with Dabao before.

35
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,919
He's really not gentle.

36
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:02,879
Are you made of iron?

37
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,319
It hurts.

38
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,680
Have you forgotten the pain he caused you?

39
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:10,560
Dabao should teach him a lesson.

40
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,120
Don't stop.

41
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,960
[Still trying to take advantage at this time.]

42
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,720
[Is this the man you want to entrust with your life?]

43
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:48,680
[Cheng Qi,]

44
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:52,000
[I can't afford]

45
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:54,560
