46
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,360
Cheng Qi, are you out of your mind?

47
00:05:58,879 --> 00:05:59,959
Just give up.

48
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,839
I won't give up!

49
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,360
You won't give up?

50
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,279
Put me down!

51
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,480
Put me down!

52
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:36,920
Put me down!

53
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,560
Put me down!

54
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,639
Put me down!

55
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:45,759
Put me down!

56
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,079
Put me down!

57
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:58,319
Put me... put me down!

58
00:07:38,879 --> 00:07:39,399
Cheng Qi!

59
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,279
- My son-in-law! - Cheng Qi!

60
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,360
- My son-in-law! - Cheng Qi!

61
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,480
My son-in-law!

62
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:43,839
Cheng Qi!

63
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,319
Jiao!

64
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,439
I won!

65
00:07:58,839 --> 00:07:59,720
My dear!

66
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:00,480
Cheng Qi!

67
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,279
Wake up!

68
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:02,879
My dear!

69
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,959
Cheng Qi!

70
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,120
Cheng Qi!

71
00:08:13,879 --> 00:08:14,360
My Lady,

72
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:16,240
