73
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,600
He really wants to stay.

74
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,319
Yeah, Jiaojiao.

75
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,079
Cheng Qi is just a scholar.

76
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:24,360
I know his attitude towards

77
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,399
the competition best.

78
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,639
Let him stay at the Escort Agency.

79
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,439
Jiaojiao,

80
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:33,159
Dabao was the first to fall.

81
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,440
Cheng Qi won the competition.

82
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,360
You have to keep your promise.

83
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,879
We are not the same kind of people.

84
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:44,399
Now I'm the head of the Xingyun.

85
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,559
Who would want to fall back

86
00:08:46,559 --> 00:08:48,080
after getting on the branch?

87
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:49,679
Go to the agency

88
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,320
and be a live-in son-in-law.

89
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,080
Hey,

90
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,639
