91
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,559
Get up.

92
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,320
If you don't get up,

93
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:13,679
I'll hit you.

94
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:25,480
My candy.

95
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,679
Cheng Qi.

96
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,720
Cheng Qi.

97
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,360
Stop pretending.

98
00:09:48,759 --> 00:09:50,639
Wake up!

99
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,799
You're smart,

100
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:56,080
and good at running away.

101
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:01,200
I asked for Zhen Dabao

102
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:04,039
to make you back off.

103
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:08,320
You never dared to push me before.

104
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,639
Why didn't you give up?

105
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,159
The champion of Xingyun can give up.

106
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,279
The speech

107
00:10:20,679 --> 00:10:22,639
can be a story.

108
00:10:25,399 --> 00:10:27,960
I shouldn't have kept you by my side.

109
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:30,720
You are so talented.

110
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,080
You deserve a bigger stage

111
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:37,080
than being a live-in son-in-law.

112
00:10:39,039 --> 00:10:39,919
Why

113
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:42,559
do you have to stay in the agency?

114
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:53,039
Because I'm the son-in-law of the Sus.

115
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,639
Jiao.

116
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:08,320
The last words of the son-in-law.

117
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:16,240
May we look back on the past with fondness,

118
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,919
and grow old

119
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,679
with love.

120
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:34,679
You said it.

121
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,960
You almost died.

122
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:40,559
I'm lucky.

123
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:42,960
My dear,

124
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,600
you finally remember me.

125
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:54,519
I know you won't forget me.

126
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:57,240
You still care about me,

127
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,120
like me,

128
00:11:59,799 --> 00:12:01,039
and mind me.

129
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:07,159
It seems that you are fine.

130
00:12:07,879 --> 00:12:08,960
Who is your wife?

131
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,600
Don't flatter yourself.

132
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,159
You should leave the Escort Agency.

133
00:12:13,159 --> 00:12:13,919
You can go tonight.

134
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:18,720
What's wrong with you?

135
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,279
It's nothing.

136
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:25,919
Just a pain.

137
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:26,720
Where does it hurt?

138
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:29,440
My heart hurts.

139
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:33,360
Jiao,

140
00:12:34,559 --> 00:12:36,000
I really know I was wrong.

141
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,360
From now on,

142
00:12:40,399 --> 00:12:41,639
no matter what,

143
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,639
I will never leave you,

144
00:12:43,639 --> 00:12:44,639
and the Escort Agency.

145
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,840
You gave me the warmth of home,

146
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,480
and the soul of writing.

147
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,960
This is my newly written novel.

148
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,320
It's about you and me.

149
00:13:13,679 --> 00:13:14,840
Where are you going?

150
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:17,360
To get you some medicine.

151
00:13:41,799 --> 00:13:44,200
The injury was not in vain.

152
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,320
Your Majesty,

153
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:03,840
my son is incompetent.

154
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
I've searched all over the capital,

155
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:07,120
but there's no outstanding talent.

156
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,120
After reviewing,

157
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,039
I had to present the truth to you.

158
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,360
Only then could I share my thoughts.

159
00:14:14,639 --> 00:14:15,559
Grand Preceptor,

160
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:17,080
do you have any good strategies?

161
00:14:17,919 --> 00:14:19,600
I suggest we bring back Cheng Qi,

162
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,559
and have him study under Lord Yue.

163
00:14:22,919 --> 00:14:24,960
and have him recommended by Mr. Yue

164
00:14:25,279 --> 00:14:26,759
to the Ministry of Rites.

165
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,200
Mr. Yue.

166
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,360
Yes, sir.

167
00:14:31,879 --> 00:14:34,080
If he becomes your disciple,

168
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,799
he can attend the recitation meeting.

169
00:14:37,559 --> 00:14:38,679
Cheng Qi

170
00:14:39,039 --> 00:14:41,039
is indeed a promising talent.

171
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:44,440
I am willing to take him as my disciple.

172
00:14:46,559 --> 00:14:48,480
The scholar, eager to save someone,

173
00:14:48,519 --> 00:14:49,639
walked right into a trap.

174
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:53,159
He thought he could stop the danger by pushing away the escort.

175
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:56,720
But the result was a double loss.

176
00:15:02,039 --> 00:15:03,360
If so,

177
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:06,080
Cheng Qi is a man of deep affection.

178
00:15:08,639 --> 00:15:10,000
I appreciate his affection

179
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,279
for the Su family.

180
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,840
If he really regards me as a family member,

181
00:15:14,159 --> 00:15:15,639
why can't we discuss together?

182
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,600
He made me

183
00:15:16,879 --> 00:15:17,840
and my whole family

184
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,399
have such a big misunderstanding.

185
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:22,000
So,

186
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:25,399
he was just putting on a show for Zhang Xi Yun.

187
00:15:25,879 --> 00:15:26,960
It's not easy for him.

188
00:15:27,879 --> 00:15:29,200
But I still care.

189
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,159
Those words

190
00:15:31,559 --> 00:15:33,000
hurt me

191
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,519
deeply.

192
00:15:35,039 --> 00:15:36,039
He's right.

193
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:38,080
He's talented

194
00:15:38,279 --> 00:15:39,559
and ambitious.

195
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,360
He shouldn't be stuck in this small agency.

196
00:15:47,519 --> 00:15:48,120
Jiaojiao.

197
00:15:48,399 --> 00:15:50,159
But have you ever thought about

198
00:15:50,799 --> 00:15:52,399
how hard it is for him to let go?

199
00:15:53,039 --> 00:15:54,200
He has great talent,

200
00:15:54,399 --> 00:15:56,120
but he gave up the top of the Star Cloud.

201
00:15:56,639 --> 00:15:57,879
He has lofty aspirations,

202
00:15:57,919 --> 00:15:59,519
but he is willing to stay here.

203
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:01,279
What is he doing for?

204
00:16:04,399 --> 00:16:05,080
Jiaojiao.

205
00:16:05,919 --> 00:16:06,919
Before this,

206
00:16:07,159 --> 00:16:09,399
I stood firmly on your side.

207
00:16:10,159 --> 00:16:12,919
But today I want to say something for him.

208
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,279
He deserves it.

209
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,080
Father.

210
00:16:24,399 --> 00:16:25,840
Why do you mention him again?

211
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,759
If he becomes Yue's subordinate,

212
00:16:27,879 --> 00:16:29,120
it won't be good for us.

213
00:16:29,639 --> 00:16:31,080
What do you mean by reading the room?

214
00:16:31,879 --> 00:16:33,639
Look at the people you've found.

215
00:16:34,159 --> 00:16:35,559
The official has already shown displeasure.

216
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:38,000
Are you going to make it worse?

217
00:16:38,279 --> 00:16:38,720
I...

218
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:43,039
Father,

219
00:16:43,559 --> 00:16:44,799
here's the new green tea you asked for.

220
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:49,480
By the way,

221
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:52,240
where is Cheng Qi now?

222
00:16:52,519 --> 00:16:53,440
I don't know.

223
00:16:54,519 --> 00:16:55,519
How could you not know?

224
00:16:55,879 --> 00:16:58,360
Didn't you go to see him before?

225
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:00,840
I did try to persuade him to write for the Emperor,

226
00:17:01,159 --> 00:17:03,000
but he refused.

227
00:17:03,679 --> 00:17:05,640
See, I told you.

228
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:07,640
If he gets to the Emperor,

229
00:17:07,839 --> 00:17:08,960
he'll spill everything

230
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:09,759
he's done.

231
00:17:10,119 --> 00:17:10,960
We'd better

232
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:12,559
get rid of him now.

233
00:17:15,079 --> 00:17:17,039
Use your head!

234
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:20,079
The Emperor wants him back,

235
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:22,119
and now he's in trouble.

236
00:17:22,119 --> 00:17:23,440
The Emperor will investigate.

237
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:25,759
If we don't kill him,

238
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,279
then we might as well

239
00:17:28,599 --> 00:17:29,559
ruin him.

240
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:33,039
Ruin him?

241
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:37,480
Cheng Qi hasn't met the Emperor yet.

242
00:17:37,839 --> 00:17:39,160
As long as we ruin his reputation,

243
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,160
the Emperor

244
00:17:41,519 --> 00:17:42,759
will definitely not appoint him.

245
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,400
It's a good idea.

246
00:17:45,319 --> 00:17:46,200
We can give it a try.

247
00:17:46,759 --> 00:17:47,799
Are you sure?

248
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,559
That depends on your precious daughter

249
00:17:50,839 --> 00:17:52,880
if she's still protecting her lover.

250
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:55,480
I know what I'm doing.

251
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:01,720
Don't let me down.

252
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,000
I understand.

253
00:18:03,839 --> 00:18:04,519
Go.

254
00:18:10,279 --> 00:18:12,079
If this doesn't work,

255
00:18:12,759 --> 00:18:14,160
it can still stall for a few days,

256
00:18:15,079 --> 00:18:16,880
until Langyue's money comes back.

257
00:18:17,759 --> 00:18:18,880
If it works,

258
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:21,480
the Emperor won't hold

259
00:18:21,759 --> 00:18:23,200
your recommendation of Ling Feng against you.

260
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,359
[We can]

261
00:18:25,759 --> 00:18:28,240
[get out of the trouble.]

262
00:18:31,599 --> 00:18:32,440
Why can't I print?

263
00:18:33,359 --> 00:18:35,279
I want to print 3,000 copies this time.

264
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,519
I've brought the money.

265
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,759
Others' books are okay,

266
00:18:42,119 --> 00:18:43,279
but why can't I print

267
00:18:43,799 --> 00:18:44,680
Cheng Qi's book?

268
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:45,640
Why?

269
00:18:46,079 --> 00:18:47,720
If you don't give me a reason today,

270
00:18:48,039 --> 00:18:50,440
I'll report you for market bullying.

271
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:54,160
Cheng Qi's work for the Starry Sky Meeting

272
00:18:54,359 --> 00:18:55,559
is a copy.

273
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,039
A copy?

274
00:18:58,279 --> 00:18:59,720
You should know it best,

275
00:19:00,039 --> 00:19:01,519
Mr. Su.

276
00:19:01,599 --> 00:19:02,240
What are you talking about?

277
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:02,960
Do you have any evidence?

278
00:19:03,319 --> 00:19:04,319
Please behave yourself.

279
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:05,920
The news

280
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:08,240
has spread throughout the book industry.

281
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:11,240
No one in the capital or the country

282
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,839
is willing to print his books.

283
00:19:14,839 --> 00:19:16,279
I don't believe it.

284
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,680
Hey.

285
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:25,400
Mr. Sun.

286
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,960
Post this.

287
00:19:27,799 --> 00:19:29,160
We'll buy back

288
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:30,680
Cheng Qi's books at 70% off.

289
00:19:31,119 --> 00:19:31,640
Got it.

290
00:19:32,039 --> 00:19:32,440
Go.

291
00:19:33,519 --> 00:19:34,279
We want a refund!

292
00:19:34,319 --> 00:19:36,119
Refund the books!

293
00:19:36,119 --> 00:19:36,799
Refund the books!

