585
00:33:17,680 --> 00:33:19,160
They said they didn't get the escort fee.

586
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:22,319
But today, you said

587
00:33:22,599 --> 00:33:24,440
it was delivered.

588
00:33:26,119 --> 00:33:27,279
Then tell me,

589
00:33:27,799 --> 00:33:29,960
who should I believe?

590
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,839
Your Excellency,

591
00:33:32,279 --> 00:33:34,839
the escort agency has completed the handover.

592
00:33:36,359 --> 00:33:38,079
Here's the receipt.

593
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:57,400
They said they didn't receive it.

594
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:58,519
That means they didn't receive it.

595
00:33:59,119 --> 00:34:00,200
For all these years,

596
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:02,559
I've never wronged a courier agency.

597
00:34:03,559 --> 00:34:05,839
Go and deliver the goods, then come back.

598
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:08,760
But Grand Preceptor,

599
00:34:09,119 --> 00:34:11,440
it was robbed after the handover.

600
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:12,760
It has nothing to do

601
00:34:13,079 --> 00:34:14,480
with the escort agency.

602
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:17,920
If the escort was robbed,

603
00:34:19,079 --> 00:34:20,360
that means we didn't get it.

604
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:24,960
Fix it up quickly,

605
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:26,800
or I'll take your house.

606
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:28,320
Get out.
